  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "> **English** | [**中文**](README.zh.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-wps",
      "text": "WPS / 金山文档 (WPS Cloud Docs) integration for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).\n\nTalk to your **WPS cloud drive** in the DSH conversation: list / search / read / create /\nupload-download cloud documents, and read / write their text / spreadsheet /\npresentation / PDF content. It connects to the **official Kingsoft SkillHub MCP**\n(`https://mcp-center.wps.cn/skill_hub/mcp`) and registers its tools as `mcp__wps__*`."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-wps",
      "text": "- Custom browser authorization (auth-guide + exchange-poll token), no standard OAuth.\n- Access token stored at `~/.dsh/dsh-wps.json` (mode 0600).\n- **558 tools** discovered dynamically from the official SkillHub (drive / wps / sheet /\n  wpp / dbsheet / pdf / form / aippt).\n- Auto-registers `mcp__wps__<name>` tools + 4 helper tools (`wps_status` /\n  `wps_oauth_start` / `wps_test` / `wps_clear`) + a web settings panel \"WPS\"."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install (from npm)",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-wps"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh plugin --profile web add github.com/zhengjy01/dsh-wps",
      "text": "```\n\nRestart, then trigger authorization (browser opens the WPS login page, use a\n**personal** WPS account — enterprise accounts are rejected). After that you can just\nsay things like \"列一下我的 WPS 云文档根目录\"."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage (examples)",
      "text": "| You say | Tool |\n| --- | --- |\n| \"看看我最近的 WPS 文件\" | `mcp__wps__list_latest_items` |\n| \"列我的云文档根目录\" | `mcp__wps__list_my_files` |\n| \"搜含『周报』的文件\" | `mcp__wps__search_files` |\n| \"读这个文档/表/演示\" | `read_file` / `sheet.get_range_data` / `read_slide` |\n| \"新建一个 docx，内容是……\" | `create_file_with_content` |\n| \"把这个演示导出 PDF\" | `wpp.export.export.pdf` |\n\nFull tool list = whatever `wps_test` reports (558 tools)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Auth (implementation note)",
      "text": "`mcp-center.wps.cn/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server` returns 404, so WPS uses a\n**custom** flow, not MCP OAuth discovery: generate `auth_code` → open\n`https://mcp-center.wps.cn/kdocs-auth/auth-guide?auth_code=<uuid>` → user logs in →\npoll `POST https://api.wps.cn/office/v5/ai/skill_hub/wps_auth/exchange` (body `{code}`)\nevery second until `{code:200, token}`. 403 = enterprise account rejected, 409 = cancelled.\nThe token is then the Bearer credential on every JSON-RPC call to the SkillHub MCP."
    },
    {
      "section": "Directory",
      "text": "```\ndsh-wps/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts     # cordis plugin entry (apply + helper tools + announcement)\n│   ├── store.ts     # token store (~/.dsh/dsh-wps.json, 0600)"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
